8100
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,580
Like I'm in a dreamland

9840
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,393
Magic powers given to me

11753
00:00:11,753 --> 00:00:13,520
Treasures from my little pocket

15893
00:00:15,893 --> 00:00:17,413
Traveling together through the vast cosmos

17680
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,339
Up among the galaxies, catching hold of

19453
00:00:19,453 --> 00:00:21,546
The beauty of time

23466
00:00:23,466 --> 00:00:25,213
Whenever a problem comes my way

25433
00:00:25,433 --> 00:00:30,306
I transform anytime, anywhere, brimming with ideas

30719
00:00:30,719 --> 00:00:33,073
Flying fast to a carefree land of joy

33223
00:00:33,223 --> 00:00:35,023
Hand in hand with the starlight

35048
00:00:35,048 --> 00:00:37,745
Dancing, sparkling

39126
00:00:39,126 --> 00:00:42,686
Stepping through this door as I please

42960
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:46,640
Letting dreams come true

47040
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:50,667
Crossing over railways and open fields

50840
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:54,407
In a blink, the dream express appears again

54767
00:00:54,767 --> 00:00:55,953
Sha la la la la

56140
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:58,560
Sing along with me

58767
00:00:58,767 --> 00:00:59,993
Sing out loud and happy

60093
00:01:00,093 --> 00:01:02,559
Let's dance and celebrate together

62613
00:01:02,613 --> 00:01:03,840
Doraemon

63953
00:01:03,953 --> 00:01:05,886
Let this moment never grow old

65913
00:01:05,913 --> 00:01:09,960
Dreams can finally come true

70340
00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:11,580
Sha la la la la

71760
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,993
Sing along with me

74333
00:01:14,333 --> 00:01:15,533
Sing out loud and happy

75840
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:18,130
Let's dance and celebrate together

78284
00:01:18,284 --> 00:01:19,517
Doraemon

79584
00:01:19,584 --> 00:01:21,524
Let this moment never grow old

81577
00:01:21,577 --> 00:01:28,910
Beautiful scenery will finally come into view

91479
00:01:31,479 --> 00:01:33,613
[Growing Fireworks]

95851
00:01:35,851 --> 00:01:38,799
Ah, what a shame about yesterday

98900
00:01:38,900 --> 00:01:41,346
You couldn't make it to such a huge fireworks show

101463
00:01:41,463 --> 00:01:42,382
Yeah...

102504
00:01:42,504 --> 00:01:44,622
Those fireworks were really beautiful

104866
00:01:44,866 --> 00:01:46,362
I designed them

106547
00:01:46,547 --> 00:01:48,228
You designed them, Suneo?

108269
00:01:48,269 --> 00:01:50,755
That's right, because my family has that kind of money, you know

111071
00:01:51,071 --> 00:01:52,576
So I just went to the fireworks manufacturer

112616
00:01:52,616 --> 00:01:53,969
and had them custom-made

121037
00:02:01,037 --> 00:02:02,291
Those fireworks just now

122332
00:02:02,332 --> 00:02:04,880
were made by Suneo Honekawa

125763
00:02:05,763 --> 00:02:07,913
The crowd was cheering like crazy

128843
00:02:08,843 --> 00:02:11,090
Suneo designed the fireworks himself?

131923
00:02:11,923 --> 00:02:15,298
Looks like you'll never manage that in your whole life

136644
00:02:16,644 --> 00:02:17,724
See you

139604
00:02:19,604 --> 00:02:21,464
All he ever does is brag about himself

141963
00:02:21,963 --> 00:02:23,477
So annoying!

143642
00:02:23,642 --> 00:02:26,597
Calm down, you've already got a fever

146681
00:02:26,681 --> 00:02:28,484
But...

156252
00:02:36,252 --> 00:02:38,085
Your fever's already gone down

159316
00:02:39,316 --> 00:02:40,195
Oh, right

160236
00:02:40,236 --> 00:02:42,624
Speaking of fireworks, I have a great gadget

164423
00:02:44,423 --> 00:02:46,482
"Firework Flower Set"

167129
00:02:47,129 --> 00:02:49,195
It's a seed that can grow fireworks

169375
00:02:49,375 --> 00:02:50,715
A firework seed?

172034
00:02:52,034 --> 00:02:53,174
Try drawing on this piece of paper

173214
00:02:53,214 --> 00:02:55,747
the firework design you want to set off

177872
00:02:57,872 --> 00:02:59,650
Like this...

179690
00:02:59,690 --> 00:03:01,329
Something like that

183424
00:03:03,424 --> 00:03:04,537
All done

185571
00:03:05,571 --> 00:03:06,634
Who's that?

186701
00:03:06,701 --> 00:03:08,087
It's Shizuka, obviously

191368
00:03:11,368 --> 00:03:13,699
Now put it into this machine

193852
00:03:13,852 --> 00:03:14,539
Like this?

194909
00:03:14,909 --> 00:03:16,902
Then decide the size of the seed

197160
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:19,006
Since this is just a trial run

199332
00:03:19,332 --> 00:03:21,255
Let's make the diameter one centimeter

201539
00:03:21,539 --> 00:03:23,807
And for Nobita's, two centimeters

204894
00:03:24,894 --> 00:03:26,832
Machine's starting, Okay!

211299
00:03:31,299 --> 00:03:32,540
It came out

212813
00:03:32,813 --> 00:03:34,537
This doesn't look like a firework

214577
00:03:34,577 --> 00:03:37,290
It's a seed. You plant it in soil to grow it

219129
00:03:39,129 --> 00:03:40,689
So let's start right away

220951
00:03:40,951 --> 00:03:42,744
Bury it with soil

225593
00:03:45,593 --> 00:03:47,974
"Special Firework Flower Fertilizer"

230678
00:03:50,678 --> 00:03:52,699
It needs a lot of water

233440
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:55,219
Grow up big and fast

238422
00:03:58,422 --> 00:03:59,940
I really can't wait!

242721
00:04:02,721 --> 00:04:03,894
It's sprouting!

244558
00:04:04,558 --> 00:04:06,025
This one's sprouting too!

248890
00:04:08,890 --> 00:04:10,621
I'm really looking forward to it!

252886
00:04:12,886 --> 00:04:13,805
Great!

253846
00:04:13,846 --> 00:04:15,649
Buds are starting to grow

258127
00:04:18,127 --> 00:04:19,858
It'll bloom soon

260928
00:04:20,928 --> 00:04:21,947
It's about to bloom!

268250
00:04:28,250 --> 00:04:29,476
So cute!

269739
00:04:29,739 --> 00:04:30,666
Huh? Look at this

270706
00:04:30,706 --> 00:04:32,893
Nobita's is about to bloom too!

273058
00:04:33,058 --> 00:04:33,996
That's right

274139
00:04:34,139 --> 00:04:36,456
So special, let's let Shizuka see!

276830
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:37,888
Okay!

278226
00:04:38,226 --> 00:04:40,455
Huh? It's got my face?

281511
00:04:41,511 --> 00:04:42,796
It's setting off now

290206
00:04:50,206 --> 00:04:53,033
Look, it really shoots out gorgeous fireworks

293355
00:04:53,355 --> 00:04:54,595
Oh, yes

294868
00:04:54,868 --> 00:04:56,442
Shizuka, you join in too

296482
00:04:56,482 --> 00:04:58,411
Make fireworks that shoot up into the sky

299055
00:04:59,055 --> 00:05:00,631
I can make some too?

301457
00:05:01,457 --> 00:05:02,496
-Of course you can!
-Of course you can!

302537
00:05:02,537 --> 00:05:04,157
Looks like fun!

305616
00:05:05,616 --> 00:05:07,031
I'm best at creating things

308543
00:05:08,543 --> 00:05:11,156
Since that's the case, let's all make fireworks together

311197
00:05:11,197 --> 00:05:13,421
And hold a fireworks festival, how about it?

313490
00:05:13,490 --> 00:05:14,449
Sounds good!

314490
00:05:14,490 --> 00:05:17,418
In that case, let's invite all our schoolmates and our parents

317698
00:05:17,698 --> 00:05:20,198
And hold a grand fireworks festival!

320445
00:05:20,445 --> 00:05:21,632
-Okay!
-Okay!

322833
00:05:22,833 --> 00:05:23,802
How about this

323842
00:05:23,842 --> 00:05:25,991
Let's not reveal our own designs

326032
00:05:26,032 --> 00:05:28,478
Not knowing what the fireworks will look like adds more mystery

328571
00:05:28,571 --> 00:05:29,792
-Agreed!
-Agreed!

331270
00:05:31,270 --> 00:05:33,559
Looks like I'll make the finest masterpiece

333829
00:05:33,829 --> 00:05:36,028
And be the center of attention again

336273
00:05:36,273 --> 00:05:38,317
Great, well-drawn!

338547
00:05:38,547 --> 00:05:40,466
Once you're done drawing, put it here

340507
00:05:40,507 --> 00:05:41,265
Okay

341978
00:05:41,978 --> 00:05:42,712
Okay

342906
00:05:42,906 --> 00:05:44,105
I'm done drawing!

344305
00:05:44,305 --> 00:05:45,232
Finished!

346053
00:05:46,053 --> 00:05:48,426
Nobita, let me borrow your reference book

349251
00:05:49,251 --> 00:05:51,325
What should I draw next?

353795
00:05:53,795 --> 00:05:54,546
Uh-oh

357007
00:05:57,007 --> 00:05:58,347
What's so bad about it?

358966
00:05:58,966 --> 00:06:00,504
Nothing, nothing at all

363990
00:06:03,990 --> 00:06:05,427
Nothing's wrong

365467
00:06:05,467 --> 00:06:06,367
Really?

366621
00:06:06,621 --> 00:06:08,154
Here, take this, it's a snack

369228
00:06:09,228 --> 00:06:10,572
Thanks so much, Mom

375001
00:06:15,001 --> 00:06:16,082
That was really close

376122
00:06:16,122 --> 00:06:17,108
There are so many drawings now

377149
00:06:17,149 --> 00:06:19,680
Time to start making the first batch of firework seeds

382922
00:06:22,922 --> 00:06:24,697
My... my test paper...

385743
00:06:25,743 --> 00:06:26,650
Test?

387292
00:06:27,292 --> 00:06:28,954
What's wrong, Nobita?

389774
00:06:29,774 --> 00:06:31,473
Nothing, nothing's wrong

391584
00:06:31,584 --> 00:06:34,188
Can I have my drawings back?

394387
00:06:34,387 --> 00:06:35,857
I want to redraw them

395898
00:06:35,898 --> 00:06:37,217
That's not possible

397258
00:06:37,258 --> 00:06:39,618
Once they're put in, you can't take them back out

399683
00:06:39,683 --> 00:06:41,956
So, to make sure they launch at the same time

401997
00:06:41,997 --> 00:06:44,167
they're all made the same size

405936
00:06:45,936 --> 00:06:47,892
Start the machine, Okay!

413505
00:06:53,505 --> 00:06:55,477
Now I won't know which one's mine

416028
00:06:56,028 --> 00:06:57,909
Alright, we're almost done

417950
00:06:57,950 --> 00:06:59,943
Use this basket to scoop them out and plant them

420672
00:07:00,672 --> 00:07:02,208
Nobita, come help out too

423372
00:07:03,372 --> 00:07:04,438
Got it

431563
00:07:11,563 --> 00:07:12,871
Which one is...

432911
00:07:12,911 --> 00:07:15,032
Which one's the test paper with the zero on it?

438840
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:20,413
How can you even tell?

440553
00:07:20,553 --> 00:07:21,152
Hey

441193
00:07:21,193 --> 00:07:23,709
We brought the second batch of firework seeds

446202
00:07:26,202 --> 00:07:29,156
With this many here, there's even less way to tell which one it is

451799
00:07:31,799 --> 00:07:33,664
Suneo's watering can is really handy

453704
00:07:33,704 --> 00:07:35,971
It's a fancy one, made in France

456722
00:07:36,722 --> 00:07:39,032
Alright, it's ready now

459326
00:07:39,326 --> 00:07:41,199
When will the fireworks launch?

461388
00:07:41,388 --> 00:07:44,238
If nothing goes wrong, it should be around tomorrow night

473270
00:07:53,270 --> 00:07:55,960
Why not just cut them all down with scissors?

477357
00:07:57,357 --> 00:07:58,493
I'm so sorry

478997
00:07:58,997 --> 00:08:00,087
What are you doing?

481077
00:08:01,077 --> 00:08:02,488
Ah... nothing

482529
00:08:02,529 --> 00:08:04,010
I saw a lot of weeds growing here

484050
00:08:04,050 --> 00:08:05,648
so I wanted to cut them, that's all

485718
00:08:05,718 --> 00:08:06,597
Really?

486638
00:08:06,638 --> 00:08:08,975
I was a bit worried too, so I came to check

489198
00:08:09,198 --> 00:08:10,155
Let me help

491319
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:14,978
I brought some special fertilizer for the firework flowers too

510365
00:08:30,365 --> 00:08:32,012
They've grown so much!

518267
00:08:38,267 --> 00:08:39,555
Could it be...

519946
00:08:39,946 --> 00:08:42,262
Great, I can just about see inside now

523269
00:08:43,269 --> 00:08:44,136
Where is it?

524177
00:08:44,177 --> 00:08:45,256
Where is it?

525297
00:08:45,297 --> 00:08:46,757
Where's the zero-mark one?

532335
00:08:52,335 --> 00:08:54,488
It looks like a zero, great!

534535
00:08:54,535 --> 00:08:56,215
This one must be it

537899
00:08:57,899 --> 00:08:58,751
Alright then

538791
00:08:58,791 --> 00:08:59,604
Nobita

540095
00:09:00,095 --> 00:09:01,417
What are you doing here?

543457
00:09:03,457 --> 00:09:05,420
Because a lot of pests have gathered here

545461
00:09:05,461 --> 00:09:07,871
So I want to chase them away, obviously

548414
00:09:08,414 --> 00:09:09,352
Really?

549393
00:09:09,393 --> 00:09:11,426
I was worried too, so I came to take a look

551697
00:09:11,697 --> 00:09:12,867
I'll help too

556014
00:09:16,014 --> 00:09:18,954
I hope it rains tomorrow night so the fireworks festival gets cancelled

563335
00:09:23,335 --> 00:09:25,455
So many big flower buds have already sprouted

565495
00:09:25,495 --> 00:09:26,945
I'm really looking forward to it

569015
00:09:29,015 --> 00:09:30,938
Some of these have wilted!

571734
00:09:31,734 --> 00:09:32,762
They really have!

574694
00:09:34,694 --> 00:09:35,894
Great!

575941
00:09:35,941 --> 00:09:37,367
I remember that one was...

578690
00:09:38,690 --> 00:09:41,083
I hope the zero one has wilted too

581475
00:09:41,475 --> 00:09:42,714
What a shame

582755
00:09:42,755 --> 00:09:45,835
It's really hard to get them all growing well

585876
00:09:45,876 --> 00:09:48,449
No problem, so many are growing so well

588529
00:09:48,529 --> 00:09:52,904
From how things look, tonight's fireworks
festival should start at eight

592957
00:09:52,957 --> 00:09:55,497
Let's split up and go invite people then

595732
00:09:55,732 --> 00:09:57,025
-Okay!
-Okay!

598217
00:09:58,217 --> 00:09:59,238
I'm really looking forward to it

599278
00:09:59,278 --> 00:10:00,437
That's right

600827
00:10:00,827 --> 00:10:02,007
Welcome everyone

603151
00:10:03,151 --> 00:10:06,958
-Welcome everyone...
-Welcome everyone...

612897
00:10:12,897 --> 00:10:15,075
Ladies and gentlemen, hello

615140
00:10:15,140 --> 00:10:17,755
Welcome to tonight's fireworks festival

619204
00:10:19,204 --> 00:10:21,506
Alright, now please enjoy

621547
00:10:21,547 --> 00:10:23,453
this fireworks flower show

633229
00:10:33,229 --> 00:10:35,388
Wow, it's going smoothly

637248
00:10:37,248 --> 00:10:38,424
What do you think?

638465
00:10:38,465 --> 00:10:40,536
My exceptional taste, learned in France!

642378
00:10:42,378 --> 00:10:44,304
Big bowl of tempura rice!

645604
00:10:45,604 --> 00:10:47,158
Big skewer of dango!

653578
00:10:53,578 --> 00:10:55,605
It's a beautiful cherry blossom tree

656798
00:10:56,798 --> 00:10:58,986
Who would've guessed it'd turn out so pretty!

659277
00:10:59,277 --> 00:11:00,913
But I wasn't originally drawing cherry blossoms

660954
00:11:00,954 --> 00:11:02,510
I was drawing a fountain

687752
00:11:27,752 --> 00:11:29,945
Great, it's a success!

693877
00:11:33,877 --> 00:11:34,886
Wow, that's really well drawn

694927
00:11:34,927 --> 00:11:36,104
Who drew this?

696886
00:11:36,886 --> 00:11:38,439
-Shizuka drew this?
-Shizuka drew this?

698805
00:11:38,805 --> 00:11:40,507
-So good!
-So good!

713339
00:11:53,339 --> 00:11:55,093
It's really extremely beautiful

716396
00:11:56,396 --> 00:11:59,644
Lucky, the zero-score test paper really did wither

725582
00:12:05,582 --> 00:12:07,235
It's really pretty

727276
00:12:07,276 --> 00:12:09,225
Oh no, there's one left?

730192
00:12:10,192 --> 00:12:11,225
Yeah...

743692
00:12:23,692 --> 00:12:25,952
This is today's best masterpiece

746135
00:12:26,135 --> 00:12:26,834
Indeed it is

746875
00:12:26,875 --> 00:12:27,835
Nobita

747958
00:12:27,958 --> 00:12:29,706
How did this happen?

751077
00:12:31,077 --> 00:12:33,513
Uh, I accidentally... the zero-score test paper...

755316
00:12:35,316 --> 00:12:37,699
Nobita!

763123
00:12:43,123 --> 00:12:45,163
[Clone Hammer]

766927
00:12:46,927 --> 00:12:48,107
Rock paper scissors

768453
00:12:48,453 --> 00:12:49,894
Draw, again

770171
00:12:50,171 --> 00:12:51,587
Draw, again

772010
00:12:52,010 --> 00:12:53,387
Draw, again

773529
00:12:53,529 --> 00:12:55,127
-What are you doing?
-Draw, again

775607
00:12:55,607 --> 00:12:57,525
I have a lot of homework to do today

777565
00:12:57,565 --> 00:12:59,661
-If that's the case, do it right away
-Draw, again

780183
00:13:00,183 --> 00:13:02,730
Shizuka asked me to come over to her place today

782978
00:13:02,978 --> 00:13:04,271
I really want to go

784344
00:13:04,344 --> 00:13:06,895
So if my right hand wins, I'll do my homework

786936
00:13:06,936 --> 00:13:09,814
If my left hand wins, I'll go play at Shizuka's place

790876
00:13:10,876 --> 00:13:12,862
I really can't stand you

793332
00:13:13,332 --> 00:13:15,453
But you actually thought about doing homework

795493
00:13:15,493 --> 00:13:17,163
I'm actually quite moved

799073
00:13:19,073 --> 00:13:21,060
"Clone Hammer"

801327
00:13:21,327 --> 00:13:22,686
You want to do homework

802727
00:13:22,727 --> 00:13:24,852
But you also want to go play with Shizuka

804934
00:13:24,934 --> 00:13:27,276
When you have two conflicting feelings like this

807317
00:13:27,317 --> 00:13:29,750
Just split your body in two and there's no problem

810529
00:13:30,529 --> 00:13:31,945
Wait a second

816839
00:13:36,839 --> 00:13:38,739
It's me, exactly the same

819718
00:13:39,718 --> 00:13:41,437
But the colour's a bit lighter

821498
00:13:41,498 --> 00:13:44,358
This one is the Nobita who really wants to do homework

824557
00:13:44,557 --> 00:13:46,942
You've got real willpower to do homework

826983
00:13:46,983 --> 00:13:48,764
Alright, I'll start my homework now

828996
00:13:48,996 --> 00:13:50,591
Hey, wait a second

830835
00:13:50,835 --> 00:13:52,954
What are you doing? I'm busy

832995
00:13:52,995 --> 00:13:55,994
After we split apart, can we still turn back to normal?

836034
00:13:56,034 --> 00:13:57,672
You don't need to worry

837713
00:13:57,713 --> 00:14:00,064
When you want to go back to normal, use this hammer

840105
00:14:00,105 --> 00:14:02,000
and hit it hard once more

845511
00:14:05,511 --> 00:14:06,653
We're back to normal now

846694
00:14:06,694 --> 00:14:07,587
Yeah

851950
00:14:11,950 --> 00:14:13,700
Alright, I'll go do my homework...

858282
00:14:18,282 --> 00:14:19,041
So then...

861815
00:14:21,815 --> 00:14:22,760
How cute

863727
00:14:23,727 --> 00:14:25,481
Don't overdo it!

865627
00:14:25,627 --> 00:14:26,834
I need to do my homework now

866874
00:14:26,874 --> 00:14:28,259
Hey, the schoolbag!

870491
00:14:30,491 --> 00:14:33,092
Looks like you really want to do homework

873133
00:14:33,133 --> 00:14:36,090
I really didn't expect I'd want to do homework this much

876635
00:14:36,635 --> 00:14:38,594
I'm really touched

878976
00:14:38,976 --> 00:14:40,838
Alright, let's go to Shizuka's place!

880938
00:14:40,938 --> 00:14:41,938
Are you coming?

881978
00:14:41,978 --> 00:14:42,818
Yeah, I'm coming

883172
00:14:43,172 --> 00:14:45,696
Great, then we're off!

887341
00:14:47,341 --> 00:14:48,402
I'm back!

890996
00:14:50,996 --> 00:14:52,126
Nobita!

892903
00:14:52,903 --> 00:14:54,543
You must finish all your homework today

894592
00:14:54,592 --> 00:14:56,195
before you can go out and play

897593
00:14:57,593 --> 00:14:58,687
You're doing it?

902010
00:15:02,010 --> 00:15:04,017
Don't disturb me while I'm doing my homework

905113
00:15:05,113 --> 00:15:06,379
Sorry...

911180
00:15:11,180 --> 00:15:13,382
Huh, is that a new board game?

913422
00:15:13,422 --> 00:15:14,488
Woah, Nobita!

915064
00:15:15,064 --> 00:15:17,307
Perfect timing, we're short on people

917354
00:15:17,354 --> 00:15:19,188
Come on, we'll let you join

919790
00:15:19,790 --> 00:15:20,733
But...

920773
00:15:20,773 --> 00:15:22,848
You're not saying you won't come, are you?

922914
00:15:22,914 --> 00:15:24,028
Not coming?

924489
00:15:24,489 --> 00:15:26,497
No, but right now I need to...

926537
00:15:26,537 --> 00:15:28,083
Nobita, come over here

932104
00:15:32,104 --> 00:15:34,630
Don't you have even a little urge to play baseball?

934703
00:15:34,703 --> 00:15:37,617
I guess so, I don't hate baseball that much

937658
00:15:37,658 --> 00:15:40,020
In that case, isn't there this thing?

940060
00:15:40,060 --> 00:15:41,258
Oh, true

941299
00:15:41,299 --> 00:15:42,399
I'll give it a knock

946416
00:15:46,416 --> 00:15:48,415
Huh, it went back in?

949022
00:15:49,022 --> 00:15:51,533
So you really don't want to play baseball after all

951574
00:15:51,574 --> 00:15:53,202
Hey, what are you guys doing?

953932
00:15:53,932 --> 00:15:56,555
Hurry up, the game's about to start

956738
00:15:56,738 --> 00:15:58,195
Coming now!

958303
00:15:58,303 --> 00:15:59,342
One more time

959552
00:15:59,552 --> 00:16:00,722
Hey!

960763
00:16:00,763 --> 00:16:01,756
It's out!

962202
00:16:02,202 --> 00:16:03,680
You don't need to hit it that hard, do you?

963721
00:16:03,721 --> 00:16:05,400
Well, hitting softly doesn't work

965441
00:16:05,441 --> 00:16:06,936
Hey, not ready yet?

967589
00:16:07,589 --> 00:16:08,803
Let's go play baseball!

970278
00:16:10,278 --> 00:16:11,468
I'm here!

972397
00:16:12,397 --> 00:16:15,235
Nobita, how come you look kind of pale?

975275
00:16:15,275 --> 00:16:16,843
Just your imagination, just your imagination

976914
00:16:16,914 --> 00:16:18,153
Okay, let's go

978353
00:16:18,353 --> 00:16:19,460
-Okay
-Okay

980789
00:16:20,789 --> 00:16:23,084
You'd better play baseball with full energy today!

983125
00:16:23,125 --> 00:16:24,450
I'm counting on you

984954
00:16:24,954 --> 00:16:26,972
This way we can go play without worrying

990120
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,468
Shizuka's back already?

992122
00:16:32,122 --> 00:16:32,997
Nobita

993084
00:16:33,084 --> 00:16:34,510
What a coincidence, huh?

994806
00:16:34,806 --> 00:16:37,374
I just went to buy something for mom

1000244
00:16:40,244 --> 00:16:41,364
Oh no

1001405
00:16:41,405 --> 00:16:43,776
I actually forgot I had to go to the grocery store

1003846
00:16:43,846 --> 00:16:46,135
Sorry, I need to go again

1006247
00:16:46,247 --> 00:16:47,861
You guys go in and wait for me

1008728
00:16:48,728 --> 00:16:50,207
This is really tough

1010249
00:16:50,249 --> 00:16:52,764
I thought I'd get to play right away too

1013490
00:16:53,490 --> 00:16:54,499
I've got it!

1014891
00:16:54,891 --> 00:16:55,828
I'm heading out now

1015868
00:16:55,868 --> 00:16:57,434
Wait a moment, Shizuka

1018052
00:16:58,052 --> 00:16:59,589
You don't have to go, you know

1019796
00:16:59,796 --> 00:17:00,864
Doraemon

1021014
00:17:01,014 --> 00:17:01,817
Look

1026602
00:17:06,602 --> 00:17:08,122
There are two Nobitas?

1028163
00:17:08,163 --> 00:17:10,684
This one will go to the grocery store for you instead

1030725
00:17:10,725 --> 00:17:12,022
We'll stay here and play

1032114
00:17:12,114 --> 00:17:14,227
That doesn't seem right

1034406
00:17:14,406 --> 00:17:15,806
It's fine, don't worry

1035847
00:17:15,847 --> 00:17:17,406
This Nobita is more than happy right now

1037447
00:17:17,447 --> 00:17:19,930
to go buy the groceries for you, Shizuka

1040169
00:17:20,169 --> 00:17:21,153
But...

1041569
00:17:21,569 --> 00:17:22,600
I'm going!

1050010
00:17:30,010 --> 00:17:31,088
What do I need to buy?

1051128
00:17:31,128 --> 00:17:32,810
Cabbage and carrots

1052884
00:17:32,884 --> 00:17:34,724
Got it, cabbage and carrots

1054792
00:17:34,792 --> 00:17:35,884
Okay, I'm off

1058964
00:17:38,964 --> 00:17:40,988
Turns out there are two games inside

1061038
00:17:41,038 --> 00:17:42,921
They both look like so much fun!

1063440
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,907
Which one should we play first?

1069927
00:17:49,927 --> 00:17:50,936
Right!

1071008
00:17:51,008 --> 00:17:53,616
When there are two different options...

1073656
00:17:53,656 --> 00:17:55,255
the Clone Hammer

1080723
00:18:00,723 --> 00:18:02,461
Shizuka, are you going to use it?

1084881
00:18:04,881 --> 00:18:06,201
Like this?

1092097
00:18:12,097 --> 00:18:13,817
That's it, let's start playing

1093858
00:18:13,858 --> 00:18:14,936
Okay!

1097878
00:18:17,878 --> 00:18:19,490
How could this be?

1102436
00:18:22,436 --> 00:18:23,791
We can keep going

1106609
00:18:26,609 --> 00:18:27,930
Nice!

1109802
00:18:29,802 --> 00:18:30,904
Oh dear

1112430
00:18:32,430 --> 00:18:34,383
Why do I keep messing this up?

1114440
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:36,247
This is so frustrating!

1116559
00:18:36,559 --> 00:18:38,114
But I've got to keep trying!

1119772
00:18:39,772 --> 00:18:41,310
To you, Nobita!

1121351
00:18:41,351 --> 00:18:43,588
-Got it, no problem!
-Go for it...

1129046
00:18:49,046 --> 00:18:50,578
Safe on base!

1130685
00:18:50,685 --> 00:18:52,165
What are you doing?

1132324
00:18:52,324 --> 00:18:54,222
Throw the ball back!

1135722
00:18:55,722 --> 00:18:57,730
Get ready then, let's start

1143127
00:19:03,127 --> 00:19:05,032
Taking a break?

1146525
00:19:06,525 --> 00:19:09,322
-Go for it...
-Go for it...

1149883
00:19:09,883 --> 00:19:10,968
Focus!

1151009
00:19:11,009 --> 00:19:12,768
-Go for it...
-Go for it...

1158499
00:19:18,499 --> 00:19:20,972
Strike! Batter's out!

1163316
00:19:23,316 --> 00:19:24,304
No problem

1165675
00:19:25,675 --> 00:19:26,983
No problem

1174655
00:19:34,655 --> 00:19:36,171
Home run!

1179064
00:19:39,064 --> 00:19:40,724
Don't worry about it

1180867
00:19:40,867 --> 00:19:42,201
Alright, come on!

1182693
00:19:42,693 --> 00:19:43,529
Shizuka

1183859
00:19:43,859 --> 00:19:44,923
Shizuka

1186764
00:19:46,764 --> 00:19:48,424
Shizuka, it's your turn

1188465
00:19:48,465 --> 00:19:50,269
Ah... sorry

1191340
00:19:51,340 --> 00:19:52,594
Shizuka

1192635
00:19:52,635 --> 00:19:53,189
Huh?

1193229
00:19:53,229 --> 00:19:56,255
What's wrong? You suddenly seem so distracted

1196627
00:19:56,627 --> 00:19:59,271
Nobita, what on earth happened?

1199311
00:19:59,311 --> 00:20:01,668
It's probably just bad luck from losing several rounds in a row, right?

1201709
00:20:01,709 --> 00:20:02,977
We'll win it back

1203029
00:20:03,029 --> 00:20:04,377
That's not what I mean

1204418
00:20:04,418 --> 00:20:06,786
I mean the Nobita who went out shopping

1206826
00:20:06,826 --> 00:20:08,227
He's been gone too long

1208345
00:20:08,345 --> 00:20:09,646
Come to think of it

1209906
00:20:09,906 --> 00:20:11,734
It has been a while

1211794
00:20:11,794 --> 00:20:14,336
But knowing Nobita, that's not surprising at all

1214377
00:20:14,377 --> 00:20:17,033
He might've gone off for a nap on the way

1217090
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:20,253
Or maybe he got cabbage and lettuce mixed up

1220294
00:20:20,294 --> 00:20:22,267
So he had to go back and exchange them

1222543
00:20:22,543 --> 00:20:25,513
-That's right, that's right, because I was careless
-That's right, that's right, because I was careless

1225663
00:20:25,663 --> 00:20:27,382
-Who are you calling careless?
-Who are you calling careless?

1227422
00:20:27,422 --> 00:20:28,750
Calm down...

1228982
00:20:28,982 --> 00:20:31,381
You don't need to worry, no problem

1231422
00:20:31,422 --> 00:20:32,804
Let's continue

1233182
00:20:33,182 --> 00:20:34,058
-But...
-But...

1235564
00:20:35,564 --> 00:20:37,057
-Please turn me back
-Please turn me back

1237152
00:20:37,152 --> 00:20:38,328
Alright then

1245796
00:20:45,796 --> 00:20:48,194
I actually wanted to play a bit longer, you know

1248277
00:20:48,277 --> 00:20:49,747
I'm back

1250438
00:20:50,438 --> 00:20:51,651
He's back?

1253240
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:54,171
Nobita!

1255334
00:20:55,334 --> 00:20:56,695
What happened?

1256875
00:20:56,875 --> 00:20:58,829
Since the produce store was closed

1258869
00:20:58,869 --> 00:21:00,355
I went over to the next district

1260448
00:21:00,448 --> 00:21:03,966
You mean you went to the next district's store to buy that?

1264007
00:21:04,007 --> 00:21:04,702
Yeah

1265367
00:21:05,367 --> 00:21:06,837
Thanks for your help

1266926
00:21:06,926 --> 00:21:08,885
Though you should have come back earlier

1268926
00:21:08,926 --> 00:21:10,438
Shizuka was so worried about you

1270479
00:21:10,479 --> 00:21:12,885
she couldn't focus on playing games with us

1273045
00:21:13,045 --> 00:21:14,128
And besides...

1274168
00:21:14,168 --> 00:21:16,088
Thank you, you've worked so hard

1276129
00:21:16,129 --> 00:21:17,103
Come on in

1277229
00:21:17,229 --> 00:21:19,122
Nobita, you must be thirsty

1279163
00:21:19,163 --> 00:21:20,442
Would you like some juice?

1280482
00:21:20,482 --> 00:21:23,097
Oh right, I baked some cookies, want some?

1285836
00:21:25,836 --> 00:21:27,376
What kind of deal is this?

1287483
00:21:27,483 --> 00:21:30,529
That me and this me are both still me, after all

1290643
00:21:30,643 --> 00:21:33,003
So it's basically like I went and bought the stuff for her

1293084
00:21:33,084 --> 00:21:34,883
So why treat me like this?

1295251
00:21:35,251 --> 00:21:36,230
Forget it

1296271
00:21:36,271 --> 00:21:39,392
After all, it's that you who did all the hard work

1299445
00:21:39,445 --> 00:21:41,264
Easy for you to say

1302638
00:21:42,638 --> 00:21:43,450
What's going on?

1303491
00:21:43,491 --> 00:21:45,278
It's your clone!

1305405
00:21:45,405 --> 00:21:46,524
He's right here!

1306566
00:21:46,566 --> 00:21:47,958
Nobita!

1311529
00:21:51,529 --> 00:21:52,873
Hey, Gian

1313853
00:21:53,853 --> 00:21:55,354
You made us lose the game!

1315394
00:21:55,394 --> 00:21:56,813
It was a total wipeout!

1320156
00:22:00,156 --> 00:22:01,660
Why?

1329800
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:11,862
No good, I can't hold it in anymore!

1331903
00:22:11,903 --> 00:22:13,639
Time's precious, but this is urgent!

1335971
00:22:15,971 --> 00:22:16,699
Hey!

1336795
00:22:16,795 --> 00:22:17,939
Sorry about that

1338950
00:22:18,950 --> 00:22:20,050
Be more careful

1340091
00:22:20,091 --> 00:22:21,004
Yes!

1347657
00:22:27,657 --> 00:22:28,750
Nobita!

1349179
00:22:29,179 --> 00:22:30,390
Sorry

1350500
00:22:30,500 --> 00:22:32,043
I wasn't paying attention for a second

1352183
00:22:32,183 --> 00:22:34,114
I just told you a minute ago!

1354155
00:22:34,155 --> 00:22:35,531
I'll be careful

1355907
00:22:35,907 --> 00:22:36,628
Hmph

1356989
00:22:36,989 --> 00:22:38,960
If it happens again, you'll be in trouble

1360073
00:22:40,073 --> 00:22:41,273
Oh, I'm getting back late

1361479
00:22:41,479 --> 00:22:42,380
I'm home...

1372441
00:22:52,441 --> 00:22:54,728
Nobita!

1376820
00:22:56,820 --> 00:23:00,253
I still feel like I can hear Mom yelling non-stop

1381170
00:23:01,170 --> 00:23:04,063
Nothing good ever comes from using Doraemon's gadgets

1384173
00:23:04,173 --> 00:23:06,586
I don't think it's the gadget's fault

1394184
00:23:14,184 --> 00:23:15,627
You worked hard

1395745
00:23:15,745 --> 00:23:18,094
It's pretty impressive you can be this diligent

1398958
00:23:18,958 --> 00:23:22,005
Even if in the end you always lose to your lazy side

1409099
00:23:29,099 --> 00:23:30,658
Thanks for all your hard work

1411180
00:23:31,180 --> 00:23:32,391
Thank you

1412575
00:23:32,575 --> 00:23:35,176
I'll handle the rest myself from now on

1424804
00:23:44,804 --> 00:23:46,224
Okay, let's do homework

1433137
00:23:53,137 --> 00:23:54,664
Sha la la la la

1434724
00:23:54,724 --> 00:23:57,163
Sing along with me

1437250
00:23:57,250 --> 00:23:58,603
Sing out loud

1438657
00:23:58,657 --> 00:24:01,091
Let's dance and have fun together

1441270
00:24:01,270 --> 00:24:02,483
Doraemon

1442538
00:24:02,538 --> 00:24:04,517
Let this moment never grow old

1444550
00:24:04,550 --> 00:24:10,927
We'll get to see beautiful scenery
